This project uses python-hwpx 6.3.0 and python-hwpx-automation 7.0.3 as installed
runtime dependencies.
python-hwpx is maintained by the python-hwpx Maintainers and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Project homepage: https://github.com/airmang/python-hwpx
Automation homepage: https://github.com/airmang/python-hwpx-automation

The Python packages are not vendored into this plugin. Their packages and
licenses are installed separately through the locked Python environment.

This project can provision the rhwp 0.8.2 command-line application as a local
runtime backend. rhwp is maintained by the rhwp contributors and is licensed
under the MIT License.

Project homepage: https://github.com/edwardkim/rhwp

rhwp is not vendored into this plugin. The provisioning script downloads an
official release archive, verifies its pinned SHA-256, and installs the binary
and its accompanying license into the user cache.

